ISO-10303-21;
/* Twi235: GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET containing EDGE_LOOP with rectangular base loop and B-spline tail edge on PLANE; PLANE: normal +Z, origin (0,0,0); Base rectangle: V0(0,0,0)->V1(8,0,0)->V2(8,6,0)->V3(0,6,0)->V0; branch vertex V1(8,0,0) IS where B-spline tail starts; bspl_tail: degree-3 B-spline from V1(8,0,0) to Vtip(8,-3,0) then doubles back; tail start tangent: pointing in +Y direction (perpendicular to line e0 +X tangent); sharp corner at junction V1 IS the tangent mismatch defect; CheckTail smooth-only assumption misses tail at sharp corner IS mechanism; GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET IS model entity — OCC yields empty; all EDGE_CURVEs ARE wired into EDGE_LOOP; never orphaned */
